    {
      "id": "so-default-agriculture",
      "text": "Keep the two-field rotation. Sow barley and oats in spring on the remaining sown share. Do not neglect the meadow hay — winter fodder is thin. Spare charcoal and iron at the forge; do not spend them without need. Render the tithe to the oratory and keep Sundays.",
