      "id": "chaplain",
      "name": "Ermenald",
      "role": "chaplain",
      "location": "fontenay",
      "notes": "Priest of the small timber oratory at Fontenay and the lord's capellanus: mass, letters, canon, and a wary eye on novelty. There is no monastic cell here. In practice he answers to the bishop of Autun as much as to the villa."
